@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Storyteller - System Component Design

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Terminal user" as TerminalUser
actor "Browser user" as BrowserUser

package "Storyteller" {
  [CLI] as CLI
  [API and Web] as API
  [Core] as Core
  [Database Module] as DB
}

database "Shared H2 database" as H2
cloud "OpenAI-compatible\nmodel backend" as Backend

TerminalUser --> CLI
BrowserUser --> API : HTTP / HTTPS
CLI --> Core
CLI --> DB
API --> Core : shared prompting, validation\nand model client
API --> DB
DB --> Core : shared domain records
DB --> H2 : CLI and web sessions, prompts,\nmessages, memory, graph and images
Core --> Backend : chat requests

note bottom of API
The server-rendered web interface is the default API client.
Other clients can use the HTTP API independently.
end note
@enduml
